        "Nindalanni pondina chote ghanathanichchinaave",
        "Naa shathruvuledute naaku vindu chesinaave",
        "Khyaathinichchi ghanathaa nichchi manchi Peru naakichchaave",
        "Shaashwathamaina krupatho nannu nadupuchunnaave"
